# The cabinet web service's direct dependencies (kd-cabinet serve / push, venv
# /var/lib/digipaddock/venv/cabinet). Pins: releases at least two weeks old at the time of pinning.
# The venv installs the full lock requirements.txt (every package, with hashes), compiled from this file:
#   uv pip compile common/cabinet/requirements.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12
#     --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu --exclude-newer <two weeks ago> --no-header
#     -o common/cabinet/requirements.txt
